    {
      "text": "A line chart titled \"EPI: Completeness - last 12 months\" for Trainingland, November 2015 to October 2016, of the WHO immunisation monthly report reporting rate: 79.3, 77.7, 80.4, 81, 81, 79.9, 79.9, 80.4, 82.6, 81, 78.8 and 79.9%. The rate is nearly flat at about 80%.",
